{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Shadow Rage deals greater proc damage with Lethal Pursuit stacks (#3939)",
  "contract": [
    "Normal Shadowblasts with Shadow Rage grant the owner's aura to its summoned hound. Lethal Pursuit allows",
    "five stacks. Original Shadow Rage has a 50 percent proc chance: collect damage and proc counts over eighty",
    "seconds of ordinary pet attacks in each phase, refreshing its finite duration with twenty funded normal",
    "Shadowblasts. Learn Lethal Pursuit after the one-stack sample so those refreshes remain at one stack.",
    "Compare mean damage per actual proc against a second otherwise identical enemy after five stacks; damage",
    "dealt while building stacks cannot enter the second sample. Assert every native refresh's stack count and",
    "completed normal-cast count. The owner's RAP and both targets stay unchanged; proc chances and attack timers",
    "are unmodified. Each mean proc hit must equal the captured native aura amount times its stack count plus the",
    "unchanged owner RAP times 15 percent per stack, allowing one point of integer rounding; a generic increase",
    "is insufficient. Original 804192 applies its complete per-application amount and 15 percent owner ranged",
    "attack power once per stack. Five-stack mean proc damage must therefore be approximately five times the one-",
    "stack mean; the numerical checker preserves the main regression bounds of 4.5 to 5.3 while comparing",
    "measured counts rather than assuming a single proc."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hunter",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 15,
      "level": 60,
      "spell_hit_rating": 10000,
      "ranged_hit_rating": 10000
    }
  ],
